        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 18\" Curved Acrylic Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nBring a touch of the ocean and a modern feel to your home with these stylish 18\" curved acrylic pulls. Available in your choice of <b>5 different Acrylic Colors</b>, in either clear or frosted.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese pulls are made of space age acrylic rod with UV inhibitors for long life, and to prevent color fade. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Door Pull Use Ideas</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Glass Doors, such as on Storefronts and <a href=\"/products/18-inch-curved-acrylic-shower-handles-pair-first-impressions-sd-cfcrbaxx-18\"><b>Shower Doors</b></a></li>\r\n<li>Entrance and Patio Doors</li>\r\n<li>Appliances, such as Refrigerators and Freezers</li>\r\n<li>Just about anywhere a door pull is needed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for FII-CFCRBAxx/18  Curved Acrylic Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 12\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMix or match the acrylic colors with the bracket finishes to design  pulls perfect for you doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
